<title>USA: Registry Q3 shr $0.26 vs pro forma $0.12.</title>
<headline>Registry Q3 shr $0.26 vs pro forma $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registry Inc.</p>
<p>		     (In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>	     For the quarter ended   For the nine months ended</p>
<p>		March 29,   March 30,     March 29,    March 30,</p>
<p>	    1997	  1996	    1997	   1996</p>
<p>Revenue  $86,518     $57,296	$231,038     $151,828</p>
<p>Acquisition-related</p>
<p> expenses    -	     -	   5,144		-</p>
