<p>equivalent</p>
<p>    shares		   10,905	  13,804	 10,880</p>
<p>NOTE: During the first nine months of fiscal 1997, The Registry completed the acquisition of six companies. Two acquisitions were accounted for as a pooling-of-interests and resulted in a one-time charge of $5,144,000 associated with the purchase of these companies. Including this one-time charge, net income for the first nine months of 1997 was $5,386,000 or $0.39 per share on a pro forma basis.</p>
